# High-resolution sources

When the user asks to commit, include `image-pic-high-resolution/` if it has new or changed files. Those 4K PNGs are the source images for the Hermes capture assets.

Do not add `image-pick/` or `image-pick-hermes/` unless the user asks for those folders.
